{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f8b009ec4e8936ed42fb13dec14d14ff.poster.avif?t=1752732440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f8b009ec4e8936ed42fb13dec14d14ff.webm?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/f8b009ec4e8936ed42fb13dec14d14ff.mp4?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>When I came to, I found myself in a hotel crawling with monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>I had no memory of what had happened\u2014or how I ended up here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u201cThere might be a terrorist among us. I feel like some kind of detective~\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The survivors each seemed to have their own reason for being here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one thing was certain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Someone among us unleashed a bio-terror attack that turned people into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u201cYou did it. Kill them all.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A voice\u2014no, a hallucination\u2014had started whispering in my head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It kept insisting I was the one responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And then... I remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yes,</strong> I came here for<strong> revenge.</strong> <br><strong>No,</strong> I came here to save these people.<strong> To survive. To escape. </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The choice is yours</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save </strong>them<strong>... </strong>or <strong>kill</strong> them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8c5bf8ba2535f42a240b713783bf6fab.poster.avif?t=1752732440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8c5bf8ba2535f42a240b713783bf6fab.webm?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/8c5bf8ba2535f42a240b713783bf6fab.mp4?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&lt;For Zekyll&gt; is a new genre of immersive horror game that combines first-person horror thriller and visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The conversation with the NPC and the progression of the main event are carried out in a sensory story format.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/b45a5a32c540faff0c278c529c2bb32b.poster.avif?t=1752732440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/b45a5a32c540faff0c278c529c2bb32b.webm?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/b45a5a32c540faff0c278c529c2bb32b.mp4?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement and exploration are based on a first-person perspective.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The spacious four-story hotel is the game's main stage and features a detailed map design with various interactions, parking lots, power plants, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/734b22163ae44964496ccb5bb2de8d5b.poster.avif?t=1752732440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/734b22163ae44964496ccb5bb2de8d5b.webm?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/734b22163ae44964496ccb5bb2de8d5b.mp4?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The multiple endings and intense plot twists through the Karma-System that changes depending on the player's choices will be a big attraction of this game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete the story by becoming the villain who leads them to destruction or the savior who saves them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/64e5a0bfc49a539d91ab4d4be5dc3fd4.poster.avif?t=1752732440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/64e5a0bfc49a539d91ab4d4be5dc3fd4.webm?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/64e5a0bfc49a539d91ab4d4be5dc3fd4.mp4?t=1752732440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Increase your affection level by freely conversing with the 6 different survivors!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A romantic ending and their past story... maybe even a special costume.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/0976ffb65a09c76b6cd569693fcc4a7b.avif?t=1752732440\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/extras/2515094cd9cbcf0ef279c6b692c416ca.avif?t=1752732440\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO AI</strong>  <br>No AI was used at all in BGM, 2D illustrations, SFX, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Ending Story</strong><br>Includes full CG illustration cutscenes for 6+ endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person and immersive story</strong>  <br>Feel the harmony of tension and charming NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857650?t=1752732440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/b9e6fd031eb625ae19969404c38d7b45a7a672f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752732440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/26e51dadfb8ead9be1f8e2c63e84926fb3afca1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752732440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857650/26e51dadfb8ead9be1f8e2c63e84926fb3afca1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752732440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","